{"schemaVersion":2,"dialogueId":"Dlg_4C214CA3","title":"Ava reveals if the hack worked","entry":"Dlg_4C214CA3::entry","exit":"Dlg_4C214CA3::exit","nodes":[{"id":"DFr_07985E5F","articyId":"72057645577585962","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ava","text":"Gideon's Grey Tech is dangerous. We were lucky to escape with my core systems intact.","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Gideon's Grey Tech is dangerous. We were lucky to escape with my core systems intact.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":525.0,"y":475.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"19227","byteOffset":15158480,"byteLength":396}},{"id":"DFr_EAD55A9A","articyId":"72057645577586000","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ava","text":"Yes. I have a name. Alan Fontus.","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Yes. I have a name. Alan Fontus.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":1425.0,"y":350.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"45823","byteOffset":31668512,"byteLength":376}},{"id":"DFr_5FFDAFCC","articyId":"72057645577586007","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ava","text":"I'm sorry. The incursions were overwhelming. Sixteen quintillion threads each whittling down my defenses. My core memory was almost overwritten.","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I'm sorry. The incursions were overwhelming. Sixteen quintillion threads each whittling down my defenses. My core memory was almost overwritten.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":1425.0,"y":575.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"36569","byteOffset":28179448,"byteLength":452}},{"id":"DFr_7239438B","articyId":"72057645577586032","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ava","text":"We are at a dead end. For now. But I will find another lead. Leave it with me.","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"We are at a dead end. For now. But I will find another lead. Leave it with me.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":2400.0,"y":600.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"37924","byteOffset":28682024,"byteLength":388}},{"id":"DFr_D2898A3A","articyId":"72057645577586051","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ava","text":"Through cross-reference with the CorpSec permits that allow the operation of the Grey Tech, I have discovered that Alan Fontus is the permit holder, and therefore the client, that Gideon is working for.","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Through cross-reference with the CorpSec permits that allow the operation of the Grey Tech, I have discovered that Alan Fontus is the permit holder, and therefore the client, that Gideon is working for.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":2400.0,"y":300.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"20528","byteOffset":15648440,"byteLength":512}},{"id":"DFr_85CDDB35","articyId":"72057645577586073","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ava","text":"That's... harder to answer. Queries into that name return security warnings. Finding him without alerting him to our queries will take some time. Leave it with me.","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"That's... harder to answer. Queries into that name return security warnings. Finding him without alerting him to our queries will take some time. Leave it with me.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":2975.0,"y":325.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"32391","byteOffset":20136040,"byteLength":472}},{"id":"DFr_A647AD50","articyId":"72057611218058869","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ava","text":"Indeed. And now that we have met Gideon, it is possible he will be on his guard. I will try to trace his current location in a way that does not compromise either of us. Leave it with me.","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Indeed. And now that we have met Gideon, it is possible he will be on his guard. I will try to trace his current location in a way that does not compromise either of us. Leave it with me.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":2387.0,"y":0.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"29240","byteOffset":18942664,"byteLength":496}},{"id":"DFr_551AC695","articyId":"72057645577585969","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Did you complete the trace?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Did you complete the trace?","TextSheVersion":"Did you complete the trace?","TextTheyVersion":"Did you complete the trace?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":825.0,"y":475.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"25284","byteOffset":17448216,"byteLength":308}},{"id":"DFr_A16A6DFD","articyId":"72057645577586014","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"What now?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"What now